                "text": "Constructing a new, larger, and more functional Tribal Health and Human Services Facility for the Shoshone-Bannock Tribes is crucial for the community's well-being.\n\nPleased that we are one step closer to securing funding for this critical project: a new health services facility in Fort Hall.",
