                "text": "It was an incredible honor to tour Gowen Field alongside Idaho\u2019s Adjutant General, Maj. Gen. Donnellan, and fellow Guardsmen. \n\nWe had the privilege of visiting the nearly completed onsite medical training and readiness facility\u2014a project I am proud to have secured funding for in FY22.",
