                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The new Idaho State Veterans Home in Boise is moving forward\u2014a WIN for Idaho\u2019s veterans.\n\nEnsuring quality health and housing facilities for our veterans is one of my top priorities. I\u2019m grateful for the support of President Trump\u2019s @SecVetAffairs, Doug Collins, in securing the necessary waiver to move this project forward.",
