                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Attending the ribbon cutting of the Idaho Air National Guard Medical Training Facility\u00a0at Gowen Field was an honor.\n\u00a0\nThis onsite medical training and readiness facility is an incredible project\u2014one I'm proud to have secured funding for through Community Project Funding. I am proud of the brave men and women of the @IDNationalGuard, and I hope this new medical training facility will help them achieve even greater success.",
