                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Idaho\u2019s only appropriator, I am PROUD to fight for Idaho\u2019s priorities.\n\nDespite claims that CPF projects are \u201cwasteful earmarks,\u201d Community Project Funding allows me to bring Idaho tax dollars back home. The Idaho Air National Guard Medical Training Facility is not wasteful spending\u2014it\u2019s an investment that will help our servicemembers reach even greater heights in their mission and service.",
